    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcDoctor_npc_arthur_dinner_evelyn_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "从医学上讲是神经衰弱。不过……她出事那天下午跟我聊过几句，脑子倒是比我们谁都清楚。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_doctor/source_plus_xunanchuan/VO_NpcDoctor_npc_arthur_dinner_evelyn_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcDoctor_npc_arthur_dinner_evelyn_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 8,
      "bytes": 73780
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcDoctor_npc_arthur_dinner_will_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "签了，对活着的人都好。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_doctor/source_plus_xunanchuan/VO_NpcDoctor_npc_arthur_dinner_will_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcDoctor_npc_arthur_dinner_will_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.08,
      "bytes": 21891
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcDoctor_npc_doctor_intro_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "晚上好，先生。亚瑟说您路上受了凉。让我看看。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_doctor/source_plus_xunanchuan/VO_NpcDoctor_npc_doctor_intro_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcDoctor_npc_doctor_intro_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4.5,
      "bytes": 42527
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcDoctor_npc_doctor_intro_L01_MISS",
      "variant": "miss",
      "text": "晚上好，小姐。亚瑟说您路上受了凉。让我看看。",
